        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 711011-OCTxOCK , Emtek Octagon Lever/Knob with #11 Rose Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Emtek Octagon Lever/Knob with #11 Rose Set features split style lever and knob design. The Octagon Lever is on the exterior and the Octagon Knob is on the interior. Both sides feature the number 11 arched rose. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Octagon Door Lever/Knob Set with Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever/knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Octagon Lever and Octagon Knob with Arched Rose Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Flat Black Bronze Patina</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Leaver Clearance: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Stem: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n This set is Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
